sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor A as Actor
    participant API as FastAPI /chat
    participant J as journey.run_turn
    participant G as guardrails
    participant M as memory (Mongo)
    participant AG as Agent (one call path)
    participant T as TimedToolset
    participant S as sandbox (untrusted)
    participant V as verifier subagent

    A->>API: POST /chat + Bearer token
    API->>API: identity.resolve -> actor_id, scope_path
    API->>J: run_turn(identity, message)
    J->>G: check_rate(actor_id)
    J->>M: load_episode(session_id)
    M-->>J: message history
    J->>AG: run(message, deps, history, UsageLimits)
    AG->>M: retrieve(identity) via instructions hook
    M-->>AG: facts visible to this scope only
    AG->>T: call run_python(code)
    T->>S: exec code string
    Note over S: network=none, read-only rootfs,<br/>no credentials cross this line
    S-->>T: stdout only
    T-->>AG: tool result (+ span, duration)
    AG->>T: call publish_note(title, body)
    T-->>AG: ApprovalRequired (body never ran)
    AG-->>J: DeferredToolRequests
    J->>G: save_pending(session, history)
    J-->>A: 200 status=approval_required
    A->>API: POST /approvals/{session} {approve:true}
    API->>J: resume_with_approval
    J->>AG: run(history, DeferredToolResults)
    AG->>T: publish_note executes
    T->>M: write_fact under resolved scope
    AG-->>J: answer
    J->>V: verify(question, answer)
    V-->>J: Verdict(ok)
    J->>M: save_episode(messages)
    J-->>A: 200 status=ok
